<Slide style={{ width:'1280px', height:'720px', padding:'60px', background:'#FFFFFF', fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei', display:'flex', flexDirection:'column' }}>
<Box style={{ height:46, flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', justifyContent:'space-between' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'baseline', gap:18 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>软件结构与模块划分</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 4.2–4.3 节 · 层次图与结构度量</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', gap:12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>FTDMS · 总体设计报告</Text><Image src="assets/logo_icon.png" style={{ width: 36, height: 36, objectFit: 'contain' }} /></Box></Box>
<Box style={{ height:1, background:'#CFD9D2', marginTop:8, marginBottom:20 }}></Box>
<Box style={{ height:462, flexDirection:'column', gap:18 }}><Box style={{ height:240, flexDirection:'row', gap:36 }}><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:10, padding:'0 4px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>四层软件结构</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>顶层 FTDMS 系统 → 第二层 8 个功能模块 → 第三层工作包 → 第四层关键类<br />模块之间不直接持有对方实体，只通过 Service 方法与 DTO 交换数据<br />结构度量：深度 4、宽度 8、扇出 ≤6、扇入 ≤3</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:10, padding:'0 4px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>划分边界：功能域 + 数据归属 + 接口族</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>A 账户与目标、B 训练管理、C 饮食管理、D 身体数据<br />E 统计分析、F AI 分析、G 后台管理、H 移动端<br />模块代码与接口族在 F / G / H 处不完全对应，阅读以模块名称为准</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height:204, flexDirection:'column', gap:0 }}><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 140 }}>A / B</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>user_account、daily_goal、training_plan、plan_item、workout_log、workout_set → FR-01～09</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 140 }}>C / D</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>food、diet_record、body_record → D / E 族接口 → FR-10～17</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 140 }}>E / F</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>统计汇总为视图不落库；ai_consent、ai_report → F / G 族 → FR-18～29</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 140 }}>G / H</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>动作库、食物库、账户状态与前端工程 → H 族与本地路由 → FR-30～32</Text></Box></Box></Box>
<Box style={{ height:50, marginTop:9, background:'#F4F8F5', flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', padding:'0 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>一个模块内的需求、接口、表与类可互相追踪，变更影响被限制在单模块。</Text></Box>
</Slide>
